WEBVTT

00:00:27.511 --> 00:00:30.773
the kind that you lose
consciousness and shake --

00:00:30.797 --> 00:00:33.693
a generalized tonic-clonic seizure --

00:00:33.717 --> 00:00:40.701
and while the diagnosis of epilepsy
was in the mail,

00:00:41.763 --> 00:00:44.439
Henry's mom went to get him
out of bed one morning,

00:00:45.324 --> 00:00:47.228
and as she went in his room,

00:00:48.753 --> 00:00:53.443
she found his cold, lifeless body.

00:00:55.904 --> 00:00:57.960
Henry died of SUDEP,

00:00:57.984 --> 00:01:00.389
sudden unexpected death in epilepsy.